# Issue #257: Export DMI Enable/Active Signals for Core TAP Accesses

## Issue Description

Author: calebofearth (opened Nov 7, 2024)

The issue requests two enhancements to the VeeR-EL2 core's debug interface:

1. Core JTAG Access Control: Export a control signal to gate internal core JTAG accesses, similar to the existing "uncore_enable" signal in dmi_mux.v that controls exported DMI accesses.

2. DMI Activity Indicator: Export a "dmi_active" signal to indicate when the debug module is actively driving an access.

Reference Implementation: The requester provided two commits from the Caliptra RTL project demonstrating both features:
- Commit 22c08e1
- Commit 41173449

